  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Finely chop celery.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f828d8210a9d71a68b9bb-ac39f2a0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the oil is hot, add vegetable gyoza, flat-side down, in a single layer.\n• Cook until starting to brown, 1-2 minutes. Add the water (for the gyoza) and cover with a lid or foil (watch out, the water may spatter!).\n• Cook until the water has evaporated and gyoza are tender and softened, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f828d8210a9d71a68b9bb-5da8e8fe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat.\n• To the pan, add peanut butter and the water (for the sauce), whisk until well combined, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat, and add sesame dressing, the vinegar, brown sugar and low sodium soy sauce, stirring to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f828d8210a9d71a68b9bb-fa3a1fbe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine cucumber, celery, mixed salad leaves and Japanese style dressing. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Divide cucumber salad between bowls.\n• Top with pan fried veggie gyozas and spoon over sesame peanut dressing.\n• Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f828d8210a9d71a68b9bb-2bcd6d4f.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
